WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.109
Firefighter 2: I have the net ready.

2
00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:10.515
Firefighter 1: Here he comes!

3
00:00:10.516 --> 00:00:15.894
Kids: Yay!

4
00:00:15.895 --> 00:00:20.005
Ben: Whiskers is safe!

5
00:00:20.006 --> 00:00:22.972
Theo: Here comes my mom.

6
00:00:22.973 --> 00:00:25.288
Theo's mom: What's going on?

7
00:00:25.289 --> 00:00:29.859
Riley: Whiskers got trapped on the roof!

8
00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:34.447
Ben: And we got locked out of the house.

9
00:00:34.448 --> 00:00:37.945
Mrs. Summers: I called the fire department.

10
00:00:37.946 --> 00:00:41.423
Theo's mom: I'm glad Whiskers is okay.

11
00:00:41.424 --> 00:00:44.461
Theo: Thank you for coming to the rescue.

12
00:00:44.462 --> 00:00:46.651
Firefighter 2: You're welcome!

13
00:00:46.652 --> 00:00:51.262
Theo: Poor Whiskers. He is shaking!

14
00:00:51.263 --> 00:00:54.335
Ben: He must have been scared.

15
00:00:54.336 --> 00:00:57.962
Skyler: I'm glad Chatter kept him company.

16
00:00:57.963 --> 00:01:02.581
Chatter: Hold on! Hold on!

17
00:01:02.582 --> 00:01:05.963
Skyler: You don't have to say that anymore, Chatter.

18
00:01:05.964 --> 00:01:15.725
Theo: Whiskers is safe now.

19
00:01:15.726 --> 00:01:17.781
Mrs. Summers: I have an idea.

20
00:01:17.782 --> 00:01:20.476
Let's go to River Falls for lunch.

21
00:01:20.477 --> 00:01:24.117
Theo: Yay! I'm starving!

22
00:01:24.118 --> 00:01:30.726
Sarah: I'll go ask my mom if I can go.

23
00:01:30.727 --> 00:01:33.390
Riley: This is a great restaurant.

24
00:01:33.391 --> 00:01:35.706
Theo: It's right on the river.

25
00:01:35.707 --> 00:01:38.124
Sarah: You can see the bridge.

26
00:01:38.125 --> 00:01:41.154
Ben: I see a train too.

27
00:01:41.155 --> 00:01:43.735
Theo: It's a children's train.

28
00:01:43.736 --> 00:01:46.645
Mrs. Summers: It looks like fun.

29
00:01:46.646 --> 00:01:49.688
Riley: Can we go on it, Mom?

30
00:01:49.689 --> 00:01:56.801
Mrs. Summers: Yes. You can take a ride after lunch.

31
00:01:56.802 --> 00:02:01.552
Theo: Look. The sign says "No Pets."

32
00:02:01.553 --> 00:02:03.759
Mrs. Summers: You can leave your pets with me.

33
00:02:03.760 --> 00:02:06.411
Ben: Now it's our turn to ride a train.

34
00:02:06.412 --> 00:02:13.551
Riley: And this time our pets will watch us!

35
00:02:13.552 --> 00:02:16.989
Conductor: All aboard!

36
00:02:16.990 --> 00:02:25.640
Chatter: Hold on! Hold on!

